# Builder Agents Guide

- A package without a PyPI sdist requires a verified source
  repository, source archive, or approved source mirror.
- If no compliant source artifact exists, fail closed and remove all partial
  changes. Do not create a package plugin that cannot resolve source.
- Never use `pre_built: true` for automated onboarding.
- Use `Relates-to: <TICKET>` on a successful builder commit.
